               .cross("You left when the pharmacist called.", "\"I was scared. I left when the pharmacist called, and I shouldn't have.\""),
               .cross("A photo of the form was on your phone.", "\"My friend sent it to me. I did not know it was a forgery.\""),
                    .cross("You presented a prescription for 60 Adderall.", "\"I did, because my friend said it was a valid prescription for me. I did not look at the quantity.\""), .cross("The clinic's number was a cell phone.", "\"I did not notice. I do not read the fine print on forms.\"")],
        openings: ("A pharmacist refused to fill a prescription for 60 Adderall presented by {D}, because the doctor's signature did not match and the clinic's number was a cell phone. The clinic said it never issued it, and {D}'s phone held a photo of the forged form.", "The defense will say a friend handed {D} a prescription as genuine, and {D} did not know it was forged. {D} waited at the counter and left only when the pharmacist called."),
        closings: ("A forged form, a cell phone number, a clinic that never issued it, and a photo of the form on {D}'s phone. {D} walked out when the pharmacist called, after {PRIOR}.", "A friend later admitted forging the prescription and giving it to {D}. The State must prove {D} knew the paper was forged when {D.he} handed it over."),
        timeline: [(0, "Afternoon: the prescription is presented at the pharmacy.")],
        identified: "The pharmacist's call to the clinic.",
        impact: nil)

